{"title":"2022 SSMO Relay Round 4 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Relay_Round_4_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd3c67c6710fa378ba458c6e0556276c8f340aed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T = TNYWR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />. Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae0734db2c961f41d5627f830ea0e5c1de76262f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{Z}\\to\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc73712d7f1001a98e82f12a2706d1004bae0610.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/7580cb0af473be727d28ee661c66c98a0a8f5a40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2)=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e5803550b5cb87d23083ccc09f35d30c5f8052ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(n+2)=12f(n+1)-20f(n)\\]\" width=\"251\" height=\"18\" /> for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. Find the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/8/9587f4255ca590d37018e5703bef62e537354e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(T)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Relay_Round_4_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the generating function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d7d29a1cfd086f0eae3e29ac02b20ec3a4dbde7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[G(x) = \\sum_{n\\geq1}f(n)x^n.\\]\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" /> We have \\begin{align*} \\sum_{n\\geq1}f(n+1)x^n &amp;= \\frac{\\sum_{n\\geq2}f(n)x^n}{x}=\\frac{G(x)-f(1)x}{x}=\\frac{G(x)-x}{x},\\quad\\text{and}\\\\ \\sum_{n\\geq1}f(n+2)x^n &amp;= \\frac{\\sum_{n\\geq3}f(n)x^n}{x^2}=\\frac{G(x)-f(1)x-f(2)x^2}{x^2}=\\frac{G(x)-x-12x^2}{x^2}. \\end{align*} Taking summation of our given equation, we have \\begin{align*} \\sum_{n\\geq1}f(n+2)x^n&amp;=12\\sum_{n\\geq1}f(n+1)x^n-20\\sum_{n\\geq1}f(n)x^n\\implies\\\\ \\frac{G(x)-x-12x^2}{x^2}&amp;=\\frac{12G(x)-12x}{x}-20G(x)\\implies\\\\ G(x)-(x+12x^2)&amp;=(12x)G(x)-(12x^2)0(20x^2)G(x)\\implies\\\\ G(x)&amp;=\\frac{x}{20x^2-12x+1}=\\frac{-\\frac{1}{8}}{1-2x}+\\frac{\\frac{1}{8}}{1-10x}. \\end{align*} This gives a coefficient extraction of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/26887eb5aac9830b268162f6ab9c060cf96b4996.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(n)=[x^n]f(n)=-\\frac{1}{8}2^n+\\frac{1}{8}10^n.\\]\" width=\"261\" height=\"37\" /> So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/7/cc79035525ec982729e61b4994d2a352afc01a4b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(T) f(498) = -\\frac{1}{8}2^{498}+\\frac{1}{8}10^{498}\\equiv-2^{495}\\pmod{1000}.\\]\" width=\"426\" height=\"37\" /> We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/7/2279b29e47c5a8a74b673503dbc54a3a8cbbf08c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^{495}\\equiv2^{495-500}\\equiv32^{-1}\\equiv43\\pmod{125}.\\]\" width=\"319\" height=\"20\" /> Combining with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b4085a74a84dd4234e5ee019820243e3796b92e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{495}\\equiv0\\pmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"137\" height=\"21\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/d/2cdd4ba860a73270e0dfc96a40322e6baa7da789.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{495}\\equiv168\\pmod{1000}\\implies f(498)\\equiv-2^{495}\\equiv\\boxed{832}\\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"515\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~pinkpig\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017223412\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2682/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26227:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017223412 and revision id 280201. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}